    <title>Mamba: Linear-Time Sequence Modeling with Selective State Spaces</title>
    <summary>Foundational sequence models are predominantly based on Transformers. We introduce Mamba, a selective state space model achieving linear-time sequence modeling with fast inference.</summary>
